'''March Gauntlet''' (3月強襲！, ''3 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''March Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during March and was added in the [[Version 11.2 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|Bears be Bare]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The March Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Be Bare Lvs''' (雛壇 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Be Bare Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[March Gauntlet/Be Bare Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*March Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|Bears be Bare]].

